sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  participant MC as Mission client
  participant FC as Flock coordinator :8083
  participant SE as SimulationEngine
  participant NA as Mission narrator :8084
  participant OL as Ollama :11434

  Note over MC,OL: Phase 2 + narrator — green = mission path · amber = LLM copilot path

  rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
    Note right of MC: Long-running mission Task (JSON-RPC + SSE)
    MC->>FC: GET Agent Card
    FC-->>MC: sar:flock-coordinator
    MC->>FC: SendMessage mission:search-rescue
    FC->>SE: SarSimulationRunner.run()
    loop Each sim tick (~1 Hz)
      SE-->>FC: DroneTelemetry
      FC-->>MC: SSE artifact sar-telemetry
      MC->>MC: detect significant event
      opt TARGET_FOUND / DRONE_TRANSFER / MISSION_START
        MC->>NA: SendMessage narrate:event (async)
        NA->>OL: POST /api/generate
        OL-->>NA: prose briefing
        NA-->>MC: sar-narrative artifact + Task complete
        MC->>MC: log narrator: …
      end
    end
    SE-->>FC: SimulationResult
    FC-->>MC: SSE artifact sar-mission-summary
    FC-->>MC: Task COMPLETED
  end

  rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
    Note right of NA: After-action summary (one short Task)
    MC->>NA: SendMessage narrate:summary
    NA->>OL: POST /api/generate
    OL-->>NA: AAR paragraph
    NA-->>MC: sar-narrative + COMPLETED
    MC->>MC: SarVizExporter → replay.json
  end

  Note over FC,SE: Flock physics stay deterministic — LLM never drives motors or sectors
